[b]v1.5.1 — Counters survive Import[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Fixed:[/b] all counters were reset after importing a game (main menu → Import). Import builds a new world and doesn't carry the mod's data, so the mod now reads your counters straight from the imported save. Works with saves from earlier versions too. Reported by Kiana.
[/list]
Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
